'''Radiant Finish''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Excalibur}} that increases enemies [[Damage Vulnerability]] to {{D|Finisher}} damage when affected by {{A|Radial Blind}} and {{A|Radial Howl}}.
<section end=intro />

