== Acquisition ==
*This mod can be acquired by achieving the rank of '''General''' under {{Faction|Steel Meridian}} or '''Maxim''' under the {{Faction|Arbiters of Hexis}}, and spending {{sc|25,000}} to purchase.

==Notes==
*Damage vulnerability is affected by [[Ability Strength]].
*Final multiplier is calculated as (1+{{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}Finisher Damage Vulnerability). For example at 100% strength this gives 4x finisher damage. At 200% Strength this grants 7x finisher damage.
*Multiplicative to {{M|Finishing Touch}}.
*Multiplicative with {{M|Savage Silence}} Augment to {{A|Silence}}.

==Tips==
*Synergizes very well with {{WF|Ash}}'s {{A|Blade Storm}}, as it deal pure {{D|Finisher}} damage.

